id: galactic-receiver
name: Galactic Receiver
kind: gear
itemType: accessory
tags: tech
craftDC: Qualified
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Perception's Natural Result 2 higher relying on hearing. Also a Communicator.
text: >
  Galactic Receiver [Tech]: A specialized Communicator worn on the ear, this device serves as
  an aid to hearing as well.
  –Craft DC: Qualified
  –Effects: When you roll a Perception Skill Check related to your hearing, increase the
  Natural Result by 2. This Accessory also serves as a Communicator.

---

# The Natural Result, not the total: it moves the die a Critical and a Botch are read off.
# Whether a Perception Check is related to hearing is the player's to say: the roll asks,
# while this is worn.
#
# "Also serves as a Communicator": nothing to automate, as for the Communicator itself -
# who talks to whom is said at the table.
[passive]
skill.perception.natural.hearing += 2;
